WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.120
I love the Black Panther movie that recently came out. I thought that was a great

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.080
movie.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.700
Cuz it gave black kids someone they can look up to and not just someone like

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.420
Michael Jordan

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.440
or Serena Williams

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.840
or Muhammad Ali

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.000
or Idris Elba

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.720
or Will Smith

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.860
or Harriet Tubman

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.020
MLK

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.800
Jomo Kenyatta

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.820
or Nelson Mandela

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.480
Now they've got a fake person that dresses like a cat

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.440
Good job!

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.320
He's got cat ears.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.840
What is he, an Asian school-girl?

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.100
I'm just jealous. Why don't they

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.060
come out with an Asian superhero, y'know?

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.180
The Yellow Panda

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.360
Where's our guy?

